WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:09.075
Check Device capacity before funding devices. A subscription
provides places for devices; network deposits pay operating
fees.

2
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:17.437
Choose Plans and billing. This demonstration uses test tokens
and a disposable test tariff, not commercial pricing.

3
00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:26.651
Review the device limit, token amount and verified payment
recipient, then approve prepayment. It is separate from device
operating funds.

4
00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:36.789
Apply the due prepaid payment to activate capacity. This uses
the subscription balance, not another wallet payment; approval
still costs a network fee.

5
00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:46.771
The organization now has capacity for 100 devices. Next, fund
device activity; no software has been installed yet.

